description	"Pirate Acrobat

^2Weaponry:
- Falchion
-- ^5Cyan ^7Style Only
-- Melee / Ranged Defense (1)

^8Attributes:
- BP Free Jumps
- Acrobatics [Stamina + Dexterity 3]

^3Abilities:
- Sprint ^3[CS1]
- Projectile Dodging (3) ^3[CS3]

A pirate whose fitness allows him to do great acrobatic feats, even avoid incoming projectiles. The falchion is a weapon combined the weight and power of an axe with the versatility of a sword."